WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  web/src/features/system/components/status/TeslaApiUsageCard.tsx feeding the shared
  web/src/components/data-display/UsageCard.tsx primitive. The operator-grade Tesla Fleet API spend +
  volume card that overlays the bare /system/api-usage snapshot (this-month total + cost) on the richer
  /api-logs/stats payload (last-24h burn, avg latency, error rate, by-service / by-method splits):

    Empty (web !apiUsage || !derived)  → <UsageCard emptyMessage="Tesla API usage data is not available yet." />
    Else (derived month-window math):
      budget   = headline "{cur} of {cur}", right "{pct(0)} of monthly credit",
                 caption "Day {elapsed} of {total} ·{resets…}", pct=pctOfBudget,
                 intent = overBudget?danger : pct>80?warn : normal
      bands    = [ This month: fmtCount(total_requests) "requests" / "{cur(dailyAvgCost)}/day avg",
                   Last 24h:   last24h!=null?fmtCount:"—" "requests" / "{cur(last24hBurn)}/day burn",
                   Forecast EOM: cur(forecastFromMtd) / "recent rate: {cur(forecastFromRecent)}",
                                 intent = forecastFromMtd>monthly_credit?danger:normal ]
      details  = [ Useful fmtCount(total-skipped), Skipped (asleep) fmtCount(skipped_polls),
                   Avg latency "{round(avgDurationMs)} ms" | "—",
                   Error rate fmtPercent(errorRate,1)(+ "({fmtCount(errorCount)})") | "—",
                   intent = errorRate>=5?danger : >=1?warn : normal ]
      topLists = [ if dedupeMap(by_service): "Top services" (Zap) top-3 desc {name→fmtCount};
                   if dedupeMap(by_method):  "By method"    (Activity) all desc {method→fmtCount} ]
      banner   = overBudget ? "Over monthly credit" / "Spend has exceeded the {cur} monthly credit by
                 {cur}. Review polling cadence or vehicle subscriptions." (danger) : none
      footer   = [ Open API Logs → /api-logs (primary), Tesla account → /tesla-account ]
  Hooks  : useAdmin (apiUsage prop) + useApiLogStats (/api-logs/stats @ INTERVALS.STANDARD) +
           useFormatting (formatCurrency = `${symbol}${fmtNumber(amount, precision)}`).
  Helpers (reproduced verbatim — arithmetic is the contract):
           derived month math (startOfMonth/endOfMonth local; totalDaysInMonth=ceil((end-start)/dayMs);
             daysElapsed=max(1,ceil((now-start)/dayMs)); daysRemaining=max(0,total-elapsed);
             pctOfBudget=credit>0?cost/credit*100:0; dailyAvgCost=cost/elapsed;
             dailyAvgRequests=total_requests/elapsed; forecastFromMtd=dailyAvgCost*total;
             last24hBurn=(last24h??0)*cost_per_request; forecastFromRecent=last24hBurn*total);
           fmtCount(n)=(!finite)?"—":fmtInt(n);  fmtPercent(v,d)=`${fmtNumber(v,d)}%`;
           dedupeMap collapses camelCaseKeys()'s snake↔camel clones (drop camelCase key when its
             snake_case alias is present, then de-dup on the underscore-stripped lowercase form,
             preserving wire order).
  i18n  : the web source is "anonymous" — hardcoded English literals (no t() calls). Per the native
          no-English-literals rule every literal is promoted to a P1/S10 key (table "TeslaApiUsageCard").

