                                budget bar labelled + spoken %; chip / refresh / retry / footer labelled;
                                Dynamic Type via tokens; Reduce Motion via TSFadeIn / TSSkeleton
  telemetry                   → view.opened surface="TeslaApiUsageCard" emitted once on first presentation

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface)
  loading  → skeleton budget bar + band tiles + detail rows (P4 leaf).
  empty    → "Tesla API usage data is not available yet." with a friendly icon (web !apiUsage), never blank.
  error    → retryable error chrome (P4 leaf addition; the web falls through to empty on error).
  data     → budget bar + 3 bands + 4 details + optional Top-services/By-method top-lists + over-budget banner
             + footer links.
  stale    → header chip + banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale transition.
  offline  → header chip + banner over last-known content; no auto-refresh.

